---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const people = await getCollection('people');
const pi = people.find((p) => p.data.role === 'PI');
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Join Us"
  description="Open positions for PhD students, postdoctoral researchers, and undergraduate researchers in ACCEL, the Autonomous Closed-Loop Catalysis and Electrochemistry Lab."
>
  <div class="text-justified">
  <h1>Join Us</h1>
  <p class="lede lede-wide">
    We're looking for people who want to combine automation, machine learning, and electrochemistry to understand
    and design the materials that will drive cleaner energy systems.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Postdoctoral Researchers</h2>
    <p>
      We welcome inquiries from postdoctoral candidates whose background overlaps with
      autonomous/high-throughput experimentation, electrocatalysis, operando
      spectroscopy, or machine learning for materials discovery. Please email me with a
      CV, a short note on your previous research experience, and your research interests and how they connect to the
      lab's directions. We're happy to discuss fit and funding, including
      fellowship applications.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Graduate Students</h2>
    <p>
      Prospective graduate students should apply directly to the
      <a href="https://cbe.udel.edu/graduate-programs/">Department of Chemical and Biomolecular Engineering</a>
      at the University of Delaware. No prior experience with autonomous
      experimentation or machine learning is required. A background in chemical
      engineering, chemistry, materials science, or a related field is preferred, but a genuine
      interest in electrochemistry, catalysis, and data-driven research matters more. You're welcome to
      reach out before applying to discuss fit and interest.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Undergraduate Students</h2>
    <p>
      UD undergraduates interested in research experience are welcome to reach out.
      Please include a resume or CV, what particular area caught your interest, and any relevant coursework or experience.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>How to apply</h2>
    <p>
      {pi?.data.email ? (
        <>
          Email <a href={`mailto:${pi.data.email}`}>{pi.data.email}</a> with a CV and a
          statement on your background and research interests. 
        </>
      ) : (
        <>Contact the lab to inquire about openings.</>
      )}
    </p>
  </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
